 "remarks": "Welcome to 463 White Oak Shade Road, a beautifully maintained four-bedroom Colonial in sought-after South New Canaan. Set on a picturesque, private property, this inviting home blends classic New England character with many very recent thoughtful updates and modern comfort. The sun-filled main level features a spacious family room, formal dining room, living room and updated gourmet kitchen with high-end appliances, generous counter space and a breakfast area overlooking the deck and landscaped yard. A first-floor office and convenient laundry room add everyday functionality. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite offers abundant California Closets and a recently renovated five-piece ensuite bath, along with three additional bedrooms offering flexibility for family, guests or a home office. Newly installed 2026 hardwood floors on the second level and refinished first-floor floors add warmth throughout. Outside, enjoy an expansive stone patio with grand outdoor fireplace and generous seating, plus a deck just off the kitchen. Ideally located close to town, schools, shopping, dining and commuting routes.",
